      ],
      "text": "The product ships 44 built-in tools across core file/shell operations (Bash, Read, Write, Edit, MultiEdit, Glob, Grep), web tools (WebFetch, WebSearch, ExaSearch), task tools, and agent tools (Agent, ParallelAgent, SendMessage), each labeled with a risk level."
