        "slc_fa43056b51746d6a12cfce5cbc7e17481028967c98ea578dc5065029d506a446"
      ],
      "text": "Sub-agent permission isolation: an Agent call's permission_mode override can only narrow the parent's mode, and less-restrictive requests are silently clamped; read-only roles like code-reviewer and security-auditor default to plan mode."
    },
